&lt;h2 id="location-description">Location Description&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>An ancient Roman town of Campania destroyed by the eruption of Mt. Vesuvius in A.D.79. Named as a UNESCO World Heritage Site in 1997.&lt;/p>
